(7785583, 1296130, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Probably my personal favorite this challenge. This portrait conveys that titular grace, for sure, but also undertones of strength, wisdom, and something I can only describe as hard-won tenacity. Part of that lies in the subject''s personality; part of that lies in the photographer''s ability to draw it out. Kudos on that latter part.</td>', 'Probably my personal favorite this challenge. This portrait conveys that titular grace, for sure, but also undertones of strength, wisdom, and something I can only describe as hard-won tenacity. Part of that lies in the subject''s personality; part of that lies in the photographer''s ability to draw it out. Kudos on that latter part.', '2025-07-30 22:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7785584, 1295951, 12200, '<td valign="top">
